LG6jMLgA3IuZ2WqBuvKMlpJqVhrsAB5wEAUFWm3mqgJIBbtkWTrp1y6sCY1EJxN8wDxP9gTy45MAlwwZs4ps1pea8a9Jy-mP2chep3bqnkabNldaFXYYz5gM0qX?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 z-0 flex max-w-[calc(100%-1rem)] flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-1.5\">\n<div class=\"shrink-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold\">6</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1889\">Dầu ăn thải nếu không được xử lý đúng cách sẽ gây ra nhiều vấn đề môi trường:</p>\n\n<ul data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"2085\">\n 	<li data-section-id=\"10h47ay\" data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1969\"><strong data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1915\">Ô nhiễm nguồn nước</strong>: chỉ 1 lít dầu có thể làm ô nhiễm hàng nghìn lít nước</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1bcmtqh\" data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"2005\"><strong data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2005\">Tắc nghẽn hệ thống thoát nước</strong></li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1sz4bxn\" data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2046\"><strong data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2046\">Gây mùi hôi và vi khuẩn phát triển</strong></li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1nhg3nf\" data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2085\"><strong data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2085\">Ảnh hưởng hệ sinh thái thủy sinh</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2188\">Việc đổ dầu trực tiếp xuống cống hoặc ra môi trường là hành động cực kỳ nguy hại và cần được hạn chế.</p>\n\n\n<hr data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2193\" />\n\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1aputgc\" data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2237\">Tái chế dầu ăn thải – Hướng đi bền vững</h2>\n<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\">\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/k2yX-BlaW0mOzEyti5AIYHtHKcYwWjN1tScf0rTHrAY0i2Kty4Mb7Ouqmssdi1MF0D3HhprymOFJqQU5f7WfH-vi-9XJ9DYQj9waWrXYSas0-lnxjLedl4H0aT9uSR3aybQ_9Oxe3SO9ZoMDzz3sj3k7C7Hg0_AG8Y4c484OnVk?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/ziBGo6If5Je2Lod_0sr6XivMKNTkwfnsLEPPXGOnaJJ3OUkvDXEAqqDeFG5xGdoemFg1sQ6IpdRwlx6HVX23A6bUzW_rQDk7JdcedtlhuxILmaXcv8yclYkmnIhFUAHYhv2PbKIlHoFFVJSxAWJEtCME5e8m8-99kNaWCeGPIi9dzCiDZIqD1kegEHXFlSdC?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/cekT-4fPHm7wlI4reY6eNRNk8TRA8VLMIEXt8Eqlf-9mYgs9CDgk8ykubupGwkABSHU-ezDidZ4hBjrAJm2I4zGJW0EA9r-3ZTmr6DBbD2GTvGntNjVY74gY-SfwPHXZk27AxkNdUGVIJw0mYosffm2vEhJ2NfzCw9SpAJytZeQ?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/gPxCjuFmKMFdMuePwGst02zrVzBXk6PVDkgATUJMkLpiVV0ib3tgEGBmHloLXlFe3L694qTK268No6er0tnI-QjgXweLTDcYxYSEkgHVzLY7KEhdVqC5-HhvmoNlRNxt-LH5GmkPfCViD__B452qJp1eLAl5aNEnl41Qr_uYsOzpNQqaXFjqM7fVinkAukTr?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/wScZ9lzPfOdAxBjg8GPt0EjOJxKBlf2U5Xz3rZJ8wK0041fsisE2adnwQ4LlhW7sGwlZ92vwKb1SKHkxCkhYfOHXwf5e5DNa97hoe650_QP9Cauuz76SJpyFB0cvt7bzqc4LZu0FMPQ733HLw5LxGVxOUUZbxO9_qHPIWEobKdA?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/dhqi8d2l51pAoSQMl9WidovQOBH2VUYWou0wX8q7y1tAsv7bTIaaIefipOnNbDMV8HD5r4lex7woGY5cEW5mgEjQjSg5fGoOlCN0_7cO3LDjAK5k26IwCbDNne9UjFGHIJLRXbv8M4On2MRxr39OrZA5dq5ORHxNbKMkHvwGbZ-S7p4VXs8Twoy0y6eczdTf?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 z-0 flex max-w-[calc(100%-1rem)] flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-1.5\">\n<div class=\"shrink-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold\">6</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2344\">Thay vì thải bỏ, dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng có thể được tái chế thành:</p>\n\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16ur6rs\" data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2384\">1. Nhiên liệu sinh học (Biodiesel)</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2461\">Đây là ứng dụng phổ biến nhất, giúp giảm phụ thuộc vào nhiên liệu hóa thạch.</p>\n\n<h3 data-section-id=\"y8o4p9\" data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2493\">2. Nguyên liệu công nghiệp</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2556\">Dầu thải có thể dùng để sản xuất xà phòng, nến, chất bôi trơn.</p>\n\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j7ai28\" data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2586\">3. Sản phẩm tái chế khác</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2677\">Một số ngành công nghiệp còn tận dụng dầu thải để sản xuất hóa chất thân thiện môi trường.</p>\n\n\n<hr data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2682\" />\n\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jnotus\" data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2723\">Nhu cầu thu mua dầu ăn thải hiện nay</h2>\n<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\">\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/S6NhmqxMgmcnxHm-ouk-QJZvaIPGMd8rehqotWeEIWEf9BXS7335_krn0th9b9pVy11AYON8wV29mnWzaKwguZ_FfJEW3DjCuj1RICVE2YPuFE2Cav-4NIaETbcXVTPzyAv8P8jMHI_RB7uyJCaDB_10qBSma9R6rRGE_cvVyQg?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/xmroE-kt5Tk4vUB6n3u7I0CLsY1hLM3tWd7Ar0FxHQarmXzicC5jCFEhHR8ThrdtY9wX4LY6-CrZfoONU34ErydY6bQcQJyfvC5Dw132mBkoQzdLtKkU2Mp4k_sjqoRulCWJYkJ_eEv3bG-OeOSxUgFmNQ6flSbd23iXHnJxkMl7E9_OdX6mKj72a1Jy5c_w?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/lFAnrAk1VWKhSesqAgM3o8PrHpgSWVetD6_5XAhhKL_5i5KqchNkXJ3mMfK1Qh7tkWdyV0HgJgDpXJPRZmuA1Ni3lSFptJE3PtDF7NkUTwgk3Xmfd_R9d43YZ_x9iHYtbQIAcVR3gghbO2FERrTGtD_oT6DAuxv0RpwFF9Db-qM?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/FYpZonruhJrnjVtMY53WKEDED1v6rNIdPZN4tbLghtG6EuiLlauz5Lct3t_LVotlF2jm8JOKUtM9AAcNvfvYsVP5Fpxyn0ljmPdfVv7mCHpxbRtyE-4IdZu_3pJK3M42iunuz7sAXFdIGW6Qx58WBe1-t-HYXWOGPK9M_Gyhk8Vhb4X7BN1vpjvrCHCRj7AN?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/FYzs9I_4zImLMdJjz7dyZY-Z6uxyGQSnJJiweC_c1N00ZCqWpYf7qVPFkr0srRz3GCG6fr8cB_NmkjoK16CmY8lQeurCfbwLslnFgTLz_rh4BuN7JAcIMm4nAXUjDT8-Gr1Jss5XISNX0ndbfC7Q_j_0s8O2mHvkWETR7hS69ak?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/9KLDJFSRI1u4QbPIJu1guKvTFqA2BvZL16BrCmEXozSKaa6urmlgu-xe3bHKMnTpXHKnAQT5pV5i-U1laMI3ms5s6o9CNb8UpNXFqyk0o-24WaGwEAjl2s0m-BLIKxx7jMDqprn-i5OW9xVADdl7yFZPo39gdDitz-fBcFOO8IjaZps2WIdfrNpbzS6Th4G9?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 z-0 flex max-w-[calc(100%-1rem)] flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-1.5\">\n<div class=\"shrink-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold\">7</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2904\">Với sự phát triển của ngành công nghiệp tái chế, nhu cầu thu mua dầu ăn thải ngày càng tăng. Các đơn vị thu mua chuyên nghiệp đóng vai trò:</p>\n\n<ul data-start=\"2906\" data-end=\"3037\">\n 	<li data-section-id=\"v5b26t\" data-start=\"2906\" data-end=\"2923\">Thu gom tận nơi</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"17ex73\" data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2954\">Đảm bảo xử lý đúng quy trình</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1rdntzu\" data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"3003\">Giúp doanh nghiệp tuân thủ quy định môi trường</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1x6rnqq\" data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3037\">Tạo thêm nguồn thu từ chất thải</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3122\">Đặc biệt, các nhà hàng, khách sạn, bếp ăn công nghiệp là nguồn cung lớn và ổn định.</p>\n\n\n<hr data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3127\" />\n\n<h2 data-section-id=\"dgtqfn\" data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3177\">Lợi ích khi bán dầu ăn thải cho đơn vị uy tín</h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1e9k0lw\" data-start=\"3179\" data-end=\"3203\">1. Bảo vệ môi trường</h3>\n<p data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3248\">Dầu được xử lý đúng cách, không gây ô nhiễm.</p>\n\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vmzuhi\" data-start=\"3250\" data-end=\"3270\">2. Tăng thu nhập</h3>\n<p data-start=\"3271\" data-end=\"3308\">Biến chất thải thành giá trị kinh tế.</p>\n\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c9bntw\" data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3335\">3. Tuân thủ pháp luật</h3>\n<p data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3396\">Tránh các rủi ro liên quan đến xử lý chất thải sai quy định.</p>\n\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1dukvg1\" data-start=\"3398\" data-end=\"3428\">4. Quy trình chuyên nghiệp</h3>\n<p data-start=\"3429\" data-end=\"3462\">Nhanh chóng, minh bạch, tiện lợi.</p>\n\n\n<hr data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3467\" />\n\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xn0efp\" data-start=\"3469\" data-end=\"3515\">Quy trình thu mua dầu ăn thải chuyên nghiệp</h2>\n<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\">\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/k2yX-BlaW0mOzEyti5AIYHtHKcYwWjN1tScf0rTHrAY0i2Kty4Mb7Ouqmssdi1MF0D3HhprymOFJqQU5f7WfH-vi-9XJ9DYQj9waWrXYSas0-lnxjLedl4H0aT9uSR3aybQ_9Oxe3SO9ZoMDzz3sj3k7C7Hg0_AG8Y4c484OnVk?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/ziBGo6If5Je2Lod_0sr6XivMKNTkwfnsLEPPXGOnaJJ3OUkvDXEAqqDeFG5xGdoemFg1sQ6IpdRwlx6HVX23A6bUzW_rQDk7JdcedtlhuxILmaXcv8yclYkmnIhFUAHYhv2PbKIlHoFFVJSxAWJEtCME5e8m8-99kNaWCeGPIi9dzCiDZIqD1kegEHXFlSdC?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/jeD2gjl1xghtU3OamYDKscSgYI1IM1ntsr8fqM9fSBKHWpAMnru4XF94A-6pRLU2jQzoKbJKscs6lSwCaweaQEFAqsPHgJ_QGKto8Lytwb2H7U4pKZJoy6qkXkn2mehwV-SOjd3vWO-4sIRZsKky4DbIPalY_DySeJUP3tnkA4o?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/XabvXTnMeV8XNqRUWXQQPy4I6kCgWs3fRmHO9EeYfo8C_uEOwj2tL2SQwZdMLarIrzcelJUN-C8g5WFAebzz77R2uA7d6wGSE5rd86_NDO8FbJoyVHVb5vWj7zRew3UD1UhySu_ZDmeYoU13AwQarvIDAEfwvhMBwRnh18CFjiNuOTLnhhkhi669IzXnA8vL?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/eHe8aioqZsMkKtMMm_PtHYYWzQi7a0fzR30tqRsOPpO3Fze6jyAlkYpGocqlVFs-CnSEDG4QyWM2ZBhw9mo0Lpt7iqGl7JEZrMgL00VZRxlnFJb6iRNjemJ1stcpil5JL2itN8ddhgacEYqqMFCGYNJGJwuNEOyWBViXfLrc7zo?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/-bfBWeBh2O0PX8TApbJLcObnH7dGWchefFqGa4EoCJBLmWpZuwE8ZpytS_TlYS_KiL7Lpo3LQEEwBDc0tctX6Z9yKMUbGbdF7H1VUL_e9F1pzpiqHihazagxC0nFm4evH_6swF1WzdhpZuEgQbSZTpNLqBCKjo_G2Da3aKC4HBxsj858nTt9zUeR9DDiqHqi?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 z-0 flex max-w-[calc(100%-1rem)] flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-1.5\">\n<div class=\"shrink-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold\">7</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p data-start=\"3557\" data-end=\"3595\">Quy trình thu mua thường gồm các bước:</p>\n\n<ol data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3741\">\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1s91l2v\" data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3634\"><strong data-start=\"3600\" data-end=\"3634\">Tiếp nhận thông tin khách hàng</strong></li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"tjodut\" data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3661\"><strong data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3661\">Khảo sát và báo giá</strong></li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1h2g89x\" data-start=\"3662\" data-end=\"3684\"><strong data-start=\"3665\" data-end=\"3684\">Thu gom tận nơi</strong></li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1g6l3xc\" data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3714\"><strong data-start=\"3688\" data-end=\"3714\">Thanh toán nhanh chóng</strong></li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"15257wz\" data-start=\"3715\" data-end=\"3741\"><strong data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3741\">Vận chuyển và xử lý</strong></li>\n</ol>\n\n<hr data-start=\"3743\" data-end=\"3746\" />\n\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2861ld\" data-start=\"3748\" data-end=\"3787\">Những lưu ý khi bảo quản dầu ăn thải</h2>\n<ul data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3935\">\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1krpyze\" data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3821\">Không đổ lẫn với nước hoặc rác</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"132p9d7\" data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3853\">Bảo quản trong can, thùng kín</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1d0rzls\" data-start=\"3854\" data-end=\"3880\">Tránh ánh nắng trực tiếp</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"jxkiq1\" data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3935\">Liên hệ đơn vị thu mua sớm để đảm bảo chất lượng dầu</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-start=\"3937\" data-end=\"3940\" />\n\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jvx1bk\" data-start=\"3942\" data-end=\"3979\">Công ty thu mua dầu ăn thải uy tín</h2>\n<p data-start=\"3981\" data-end=\"4105\">Nếu bạn đang tìm đơn vị thu mua dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng chuyên nghiệp, <strong data-start=\"4050\" data-end=\"4075\">Công ty XNK Ánh Trang</strong> là lựa chọn đáng tin cậy với:</p>\n\n<ul data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4215\">\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1lqaeu\" data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4139\">Thu mua số lượng lớn toàn quốc</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1rbydtv\" data-start=\"4140\" data-end=\"4161\">Giá cao, cạnh tranh</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"12nvsjg\" data-start=\"4162\" data-end=\"4187\">Hỗ trợ nhanh chóng 24/7</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"16hgg9a\" data-start=\"4188\" data-end=\"4215\">Đầy đủ pháp lý, minh bạch</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-start=\"4217\" data-end=\"4220\" />\n\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1a8fy49\" data-start=\"4222\" data-end=\"4242\">Thông tin liên hệ</h2>\n<p data-start=\"4244\" data-end=\"4429\"><strong data-start=\"4244\" data-end=\"4269\">Công ty XNK Ánh Trang</strong><br data-start=\"4269\" data-end=\"4272\" />🌐 Website: <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"http://www.dauphethai.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"4284\" data-end=\"4301\">www.dauphethai.vn</a> | <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"http://www.anhtrangexport.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"4304\" data-end=\"4325\">www.anhtrangexport.vn </a> |<a href=\"https://dauandaquasudung.com/\"> dauandaquasudung.com</a></p>\n<p data-start=\"4244\" data-end=\"4429\">📧 Email: <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"4338\" data-end=\"4360\">info@anhtrangexport.vn</a><br data-start=\"4360\" data-end=\"4363\" />☎️ Điện thoại: 02436830880<br data-start=\"4389\" data-end=\"4392\" />📞 Hotline: <a href=\"http://zalo.me/84965069880\">0965069880</a> | 0943949083</p>\n\n\n<hr data-start=\"4431\" data-end=\"4434\" />\n\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11x5u5b\" data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4447\">Kết luận</h2>\n<p data-start=\"4449\" data-end=\"4721\">Dầu ăn thải không chỉ là rác thải mà còn là nguồn tài nguyên có thể tái chế và mang lại giá trị kinh tế cao nếu được xử lý đúng cách. Việc nâng cao nhận thức và hợp tác với các đơn vị thu mua uy tín sẽ góp phần bảo vệ môi trường, sức khỏe cộng đồng và phát triển bền vững.</p>\n<p data-start=\"4723\" data-end=\"4846\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Nếu bạn đang có nhu cầu bán dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng, đừng ngần ngại liên hệ ngay để được hỗ trợ nhanh chóng và hiệu quả nhất.</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div>\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\n<div class=\"text-center\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section></div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>','Dầu Ăn Thải Là Gì? Tác Hại & Giải Pháp Thu Gom Hiệu Quả','','inherit','closed','closed','','1824-revision-v1','','','2026-04-24 23:43:02','2026-04-24 16:43:02','',1824,'https://dauandaquasudung.com/?p=1826',0,'revision','',0),(1828,4,'2026-04-28 00:12:48','2026-04-27 17:12:48','<h2 data-section-id=\"kdm190\" data-start=\"75\" data-end=\"129\">Giới thiệu về dịch vụ thu mua dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng</h2>\r\n<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/sjPiBW8rNe9JxCUFPwNqBLNim5OvhNBFYvreX29QIBkWWfSkDt_iZ-XGTWArMfZIWSv81gWrHW1XpyDRHZr-n9uSvE4blQu8ujFlFSeVhoDJKFNrICVc7JIzKA9qxq9kbMKsKkW1KHp0D6TlyBrts00H-ECp2-FkuVogol1CBZc?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/S1ctuR-SE0JhOc__HHdg3pf_-LiAUfqKiITGfJ8wlDTLvc3AHqhErJ6sCjdRZyxQ40iggMS_0hVN-YuGcQe09pd9yF67UqnNFBGpGLEHzIOHiwt_JN31WB7uO3Kzz7QQx6wSNKPCPU0gVXUZVCknNSMROddq8jw7-JEexOJiCosB9DViKJFCE47qdKA3C-9m?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/lFAnrAk1VWKhSesqAgM3o8PrHpgSWVetD6_5XAhhKL_5i5KqchNkXJ3mMfK1Qh7tkWdyV0HgJgDpXJPRZmuA1Ni3lSFptJE3PtDF7NkUTwgk3Xmfd_R9d43YZ_x9iHYtbQIAcVR3gghbO2FERrTGtD_oT6DAuxv0RpwFF9Db-qM?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/FYpZonruhJrnjVtMY53WKEDED1v6rNIdPZN4tbLghtG6EuiLlauz5Lct3t_LVotlF2jm8JOKUtM9AAcNvfvYsVP5Fpxyn0ljmPdfVv7mCHpxbRtyE-4IdZu_3pJK3M42iunuz7sAXFdIGW6Qx58WBe1-t-HYXWOGPK9M_Gyhk8Vhb4X7BN1vpjvrCHCRj7AN?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/f7TkGYYBh18ukT1Uo136VaFSuMfOOh7b2O8pOEwKaxpPouWIJHxhHl5faB3QNI4vg9AraAyn5SqYnMAcmkQ_vwaY2u4VWbrNb4WR7LYzgKC4zG2ZgsP7jyyypDOt-dRK8mygbhIaWrMY7ZPoUpC6EMvocD1f5lr_7JCk7g0e1oo?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/cp4omZACJN0m1AYKdUAv8RRKk0EvovWCsgFXF3Wu6esaGtixqfbOw8npx8lUEhNQy9gmc3gCfY4Hjw7cQlb09s8y6nZnT1IhL5l292_8xiJRlxq3gW9RndXF9uyaQlp7yvyTEg0C2dB4O1omc8qyWQ3ssjPGNBb0cs4irFWoIMJLQcvii_YNuXEl-5yG-H9Y?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 z-0 flex max-w-[calc(100%-1rem)] flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-1.5\">\r\n<div class=\"shrink-0\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold\">5</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"173\" data-end=\"543\">Trong bối cảnh vấn đề môi trường ngày càng được quan tâm, việc xử lý dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng (dầu thải) đang trở thành một nhu cầu cấp thiết đối với các nhà hàng, quán ăn, bếp ăn công nghiệp và cả hộ gia đình. Dầu ăn sau khi sử dụng nếu không được thu gom và xử lý đúng cách có thể gây ô nhiễm môi trường nghiêm trọng, đồng thời ảnh hưởng trực tiếp đến sức khỏe con người.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"810\">Chính vì vậy, dịch vụ <strong data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"600\">thu mua dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng</strong> ra đời nhằm giải quyết bài toán này một cách hiệu quả. Không chỉ giúp khách hàng xử lý dầu thải nhanh chóng, dịch vụ còn mang lại giá trị kinh tế thông qua việc thu mua với giá cao, minh bạch và chuyên nghiệp.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"815\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1iomxzb\" data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"848\">Dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng là gì?</h2>\r\n<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/wZnmDfrATermmnKP52n-QXWXA3iLVpdfEwukvlZ4yrGHYkaqp2N4gnySipzF8oCSM72YAqmT_hAFGCBPHvd0v4QWvWlLRvzcU5o_dEjU47NjA2f2SgPi4MGQ00tH84BeMi_2RLJKr692EOjCMZXyB2XA0-1pUmCO4pkVF7N2uhw?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/p4ieMhKUjrK3-ja3bQXTQ1pFJmyjsS0_-PZQT3Z_9lUzd43HX9QOPQ4QH0rR9ccq_7-8ycYH-UkX2BxErgt2ZM77yl4eN1NVyu3wfqs7iYwSNqM90fgCxlimw0UTBnpfaD4mkr1MPhOXt0uAtvMXHHWgLTm47XwMvPd8hnSlobFLghADLL2nZlHT2DGNBVN3?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/FPaqVDWffTvASLRhgZcbk7ZELjUjj7Gqiv7lziGEpTqBmlNOKIXfbvfiq6Efxl2qv3h4OoBxJ6M3_KWNp6Fbjfs_zzYM4aGpLhn6hWso6TIisMyYLPTDxDkzJgmaRie5y9boIZryL1nZWNo8F7XLA5UkY34NvO88vWs-Vg_mvHw?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/qIY_jsDeS4tbPCcAXFMBuYm93twZnY5Tfoc16vGwYm1mVkZvOFEXRLStDpvpkr7HH4VoBTLMUxi3iU1TLpn2euGLH_n46h6IISfHMbhWiRFiNflZLJuTfXxB4wvwGaoJkALZMPyu5r6TFSEvwLdZ6RpulLPIEVAjGtK68uFSYTCPO2tqa_4yq0_alD3vZm2I?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/lFnrvID9XWEvaLqBOz7unDnBfWqYSBv6dmBCG3hu9oGhxum1fugPFjtVwqozUC0SB3xRFTHu7bIIyvi6X6bZSO_PvoClPB9_ev8j9Tq0LYjekdbjD8f1gruXi_z87MmJsKl4R8mXMk62rJJK-P0bE6ed6VFnEhhOsSOoXNQV7eI?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/UEDAFbU6SxkL4W9Dk-XCuNZswz77_D11EA9-IDcRSeFh-d77Ai-ngfP73Y_Z7-ebH4UE9TiCTKqfnLXu_i3WDjExf8ER2jJ4ToAfqmdqqFnRYJnZ9OG2YsCHIUFFvTwutGYnDYjLg4wC9sHxoBdK3kJE99yTe8YyjHHBFLq-qmcyuRwJqO7QxZNq7uaKArQf?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"1085\">Dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng là loại dầu đã được dùng trong quá trình chế biến thực phẩm như chiên, xào nhiều lần. Sau một thời gian sử dụng, dầu sẽ bị biến đổi về màu sắc, mùi vị và cấu trúc hóa học.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1135\">Một số dấu hiệu nhận biết dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1wkpp7k\" data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1173\">Màu chuyển sang nâu đậm hoặc đen</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"yfsuia\" data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1199\">Có mùi khét, khó chịu</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"6jsv3f\" data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1230\">Xuất hiện cặn bẩn hoặc bọt</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"14hc931\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1258\">Độ nhớt tăng bất thường</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1399\">Việc tiếp tục sử dụng loại dầu này trong chế biến thực phẩm có thể tạo ra các chất độc hại, gây nguy cơ ung thư và nhiều bệnh lý nguy hiểm.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1404\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3bi1c2\" data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1463\">Tác hại của dầu ăn thải đối với môi trường và sức khỏe</h2>\r\n<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/3rPle9Er4hI3Rn7P77ShGIMXcJvnXTqiuIE31X-hmBPZsGOerAtVWjvkKsk0TDGGtunKrSpUNs_ioQGkFiMC6eyaHnov8Ngui34z7ZssUAdXVbdgmLcctNJbgBHDFZLGMz6-O4J4-ArdUplw7JIHTRstnFXlREraJ8E1b7UcxFw?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/CdZMOLr_Wqj3eqe0PtXTYN3xRE1sDlGz381OHwBYt6qNGo7hlGYtboW455XqCEkWGdN3LAP0up1zca8d9wfctF-KglKlgif-JkOU3ssYpJO4LBFqF4ow8bW05NPpCk0lV5Uy8JYFA3IaBJ7mUd3LOXtpFOcpzB3mkVcXbvQ-KJRnk0SBFDXX44OuF7jj4bXV?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/HEGF4spFb8KZkiCWKjRagoq42UygdOcenpf69rz_TlQHDtF7D1-0gifMcoRqKiTEJf-_2HQWG9I8xgDGcSWlcUb_mzfuwckVZRIfHl3-eG2MqEl2PKG1kmUGCWNhY9a2DQDcjKVqNKU4Nn1I5at9R7OYFdZX4Jw46YE8y0hAhzk?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/rDwNjI2A7szEGsswZ0iksbuLbUNDy1H3q3UhWvaIe9hLOC_E8kF4H6rfleeKNPUsFBpPgzBmOLp32u2puI7NVDGX2F8T6QUr9M1cSDoIi5QPjyt6Forse34DAvQPzmozDgKImFn75PClWbWM71sVWCabDIOgQxJQvt0rkLzZ7QXAGuUWf1BdEG9yCUoMbkjB?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/6nnzCDGGj8yHKJZGfctZC_xc81FSzU9581Oymm5KaFT-X6vPXW1mDVh67FkqnXYmP_MO_gsBxReDADAEDqSgfup9M76pHXYY1VFtakq4vjEGCgdyqvBt8RV7SLAJH7DtPvM13QDmEXyFnwP0SXHNccz2egk2Io9N7Sfu87GrqBY?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/h6-Ohra4PLmBKqqzMa9EVbTaF-rOwp59xnB1rF9iVOv7bmXiSOUMiD81mUSxViX95yDc-W1izwTDYLNZuc1kW58yErwzzizxxT7NIsbjQlH318w-Ow8H24T0s2tMGXiAiMfiyXG-LNo-VtcOjdaweYsrAGJq8P6IeOFF2Mfq4kxkboLMFzqeQEOK9MNhC3YB?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 z-0 flex max-w-[calc(100%-1rem)] flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-1.5\">\r\n<div class=\"shrink-0\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold\">5</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ecmftu\" data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1541\">1. Gây ô nhiễm môi trường nước</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1706\">Khi dầu ăn thải bị đổ trực tiếp xuống cống hoặc môi trường, nó sẽ tạo thành lớp màng trên bề mặt nước, ngăn cản oxy hòa tan và ảnh hưởng đến hệ sinh thái thủy sinh.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"aij3x7\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1744\">2. Tắc nghẽn hệ thống thoát nước</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1861\">Dầu mỡ tích tụ lâu ngày trong đường ống sẽ gây tắc nghẽn, làm phát sinh chi phí sửa chữa và ảnh hưởng đến sinh hoạt.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1loc375\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1889\">3. Nguy cơ tái chế bẩn</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"2014\">Một số cơ sở không uy tín có thể thu gom dầu thải để tái chế thành dầu ăn kém chất lượng, gây nguy hiểm cho người tiêu dùng.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"yhff52\" data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2045\">4. Ảnh hưởng đến sức khỏe</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2159\">Dầu chiên đi chiên lại sinh ra các chất độc như aldehyde, acrylamide – có liên quan đến ung thư và bệnh tim mạch.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2164\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1js3ngk\" data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2226\">Lợi ích khi sử dụng dịch vụ thu mua dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng</h2>\r\n<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/lFAnrAk1VWKhSesqAgM3o8PrHpgSWVetD6_5XAhhKL_5i5KqchNkXJ3mMfK1Qh7tkWdyV0HgJgDpXJPRZmuA1Ni3lSFptJE3PtDF7NkUTwgk3Xmfd_R9d43YZ_x9iHYtbQIAcVR3gghbO2FERrTGtD_oT6DAuxv0RpwFF9Db-qM?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/FYpZonruhJrnjVtMY53WKEDED1v6rNIdPZN4tbLghtG6EuiLlauz5Lct3t_LVotlF2jm8JOKUtM9AAcNvfvYsVP5Fpxyn0ljmPdfVv7mCHpxbRtyE-4IdZu_3pJK3M42iunuz7sAXFdIGW6Qx58WBe1-t-HYXWOGPK9M_Gyhk8Vhb4X7BN1vpjvrCHCRj7AN?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/f7TkGYYBh18ukT1Uo136VaFSuMfOOh7b2O8pOEwKaxpPouWIJHxhHl5faB3QNI4vg9AraAyn5SqYnMAcmkQ_vwaY2u4VWbrNb4WR7LYzgKC4zG2ZgsP7jyyypDOt-dRK8mygbhIaWrMY7ZPoUpC6EMvocD1f5lr_7JCk7g0e1oo?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/cp4omZACJN0m1AYKdUAv8RRKk0EvovWCsgFXF3Wu6esaGtixqfbOw8npx8lUEhNQy9gmc3gCfY4Hjw7cQlb09s8y6nZnT1IhL5l292_8xiJRlxq3gW9RndXF9uyaQlp7yvyTEg0C2dB4O1omc8qyWQ3ssjPGNBb0cs4irFWoIMJLQcvii_YNuXEl-5yG-H9Y?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/YoMi-GbcZnwa6YNK7wPEGP4ED1DQlGOlriDXaoV6bTV_rH_6_1zfvyLnG_aT2ZO02X1VCr3Y5rJr7IKtl9HV2-WOMQJrTeTr_4w9aVffnYWBb2Ch9nd8jTAwFy51ikFbVxcqkdkHj3YX6JLTt8oTXk77y5dYDNzgZPaWqKp2kxk?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/jVA-JAosQmzkAD547kkcVRAcIg7bME95vs3J1v1dxAntKlAsvu6QHqNUMFAj4-58IwY44y1SZG7B-OxuGG9w0gkoVpZyNzEu8N5TXr-bOP7N9-ob8ffBywZR8esWV5RAF6vXF0U2qDHJRVaKJe9wkxA0pBRQ_B1I7w6OtYcIJDurstgxxkf5G9AljXtYqTjF?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14017wv\" data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2301\">1. Tăng thêm nguồn thu nhập</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2378\">Thay vì bỏ đi, bạn có thể bán lại dầu ăn thải để tạo thêm lợi nhuận ổn định.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ws314n\" data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2404\">2. Bảo vệ môi trường</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2480\">Dầu thải được thu gom và xử lý đúng quy trình, góp phần giảm thiểu ô nhiễm.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"yq2vlb\" data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2512\">3. Tiện lợi và nhanh chóng</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2589\">Dịch vụ thu mua tận nơi giúp tiết kiệm thời gian và công sức cho khách hàng.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"b8ai2c\" data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2613\">4. Đảm bảo pháp lý</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2709\">Đối với các doanh nghiệp, việc xử lý dầu thải đúng quy định giúp tránh các rủi ro về pháp luật.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2714\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17r1l5q\" data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2758\">Quy trình thu mua dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng</h2>\r\n<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/f7TkGYYBh18ukT1Uo136VaFSuMfOOh7b2O8pOEwKaxpPouWIJHxhHl5faB3QNI4vg9AraAyn5SqYnMAcmkQ_vwaY2u4VWbrNb4WR7LYzgKC4zG2ZgsP7jyyypDOt-dRK8mygbhIaWrMY7ZPoUpC6EMvocD1f5lr_7JCk7g0e1oo?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/cp4omZACJN0m1AYKdUAv8RRKk0EvovWCsgFXF3Wu6esaGtixqfbOw8npx8lUEhNQy9gmc3gCfY4Hjw7cQlb09s8y6nZnT1IhL5l292_8xiJRlxq3gW9RndXF9uyaQlp7yvyTEg0C2dB4O1omc8qyWQ3ssjPGNBb0cs4irFWoIMJLQcvii_YNuXEl-5yG-H9Y?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/7YDg6AIBej_CLVdhFl5sILZ9xien44VNkkvJMKjPMNz_mTQKlaqxn6xx8tpzXVIA0fE7Zvaxh9N2acx4nMwRpcjnbkWqPhV7RRmdphhTrNUmzVeW3fZvo-kmN80nFiE-FJ-VR_S09MZGXl3okleTnUc5UBlrAtEjNc2FD6RkCnU?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/daeL9DLVMySTB3uW-WR1RgL47TqsSZXYQ-RUeNa-hfZ7q-PjjVtAqcktieCfCnY5AuNp9S86muCnHGVxjV_n-KGsI6vN1tHPgtH2DU6Pt19VbSVeXKQiLphSyViQUOqjBUt3z8aoN17yIOiQOp3LDgJRse4uawGNboj04qBWFW3VkAVSZzXhSQ0brXx-jOS5?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2868\">Chúng tôi triển khai quy trình thu mua chuyên nghiệp gồm các bước:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2976\"><strong data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2901\">Bước 1: Tiếp nhận thông tin</strong><br data-start=\"2901\" data-end=\"2904\" />Khách hàng liên hệ cung cấp thông tin về loại dầu, số lượng và địa điểm.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"3088\"><strong data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"3009\">Bước 2: Báo giá nhanh chóng</strong><br data-start=\"3009\" data-end=\"3012\" />Dựa trên thị trường và chất lượng dầu, chúng tôi đưa ra mức giá hợp lý nhất.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3090\" data-end=\"3183\"><strong data-start=\"3090\" data-end=\"3117\">Bước 3: Thu gom tận nơi</strong><br data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3120\" />Nhân viên đến trực tiếp để thu gom, đảm bảo sạch sẽ và an toàn.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3284\"><strong data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3217\">Bước 4: Thanh toán linh hoạt</strong><br data-start=\"3217\" data-end=\"3220\" />Thanh toán ngay sau khi thu mua bằng tiền mặt hoặc chuyển khoản.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"3286\" data-end=\"3289\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8bpsmr\" data-start=\"3291\" data-end=\"3328\">Ứng dụng của dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng</h2>\r\n<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/-2ZRoObndDkfWxKnM0FHrBa3IOa7emOGd0cNqECgsRPu-Xm1VCPs7sMyTEqt1rz_cAKN1F6n37GdSbmEk9fovCy5-S28Par_VQ1jVZRGik-mgYkyk072WWW9RWJG_cZMu5oUiDuR2b-0E7hV7RDZEVQzE5OINQrKw1OOoTtV7rU?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/AmnY8kzzULbWZ05qn6PIphfkMez0bPRlOsLc0nN24ILq74nxoAWWz-LsE8E9VcIV_0qb9QsQ-80Fm0eBJMx71S11I5i52JeItwctJ3mP0fU5v_mOAKToEJpdBa3wTXgefQ7TWXD6QkxMD1tbQs5ghlsTxcB-SejwyfSRdN8wJH7HYelXT5i_zJafQ-CroCBP?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/BnmwVg21QIwLj6mIl7O_QNJfIQqjCGdAmdswp30DKBA2NjxC6QWKaNQllvBFsS1J3djCrL6oojEGLTVxwHdyi21NMvGIKrYuXNvk8wecy1FcBPY86-Uu8BF7dvEYta7AwyXYs97f1TRUf-Bw7JnrlwgOClfiluzyKSKGq6q2P2w?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/JfGmoOFD5XotE0CJrwhsRlF3onhvl1984EekKqZO3ZZU00BGulICGwy8vR7HXlX7yAaXD7BPWy4uDozLcqHFBrdsoxcPdxhvD3ZBI7_9ffacx-TQ3GTTkpDrCR0UyNRI4uSZJcy-Nl1rjjxj9vyMjpMr1MoUN8gsY7WNAilHEP_cYXEUHtmVVgEMZ9n37db1?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/Or6AtL4_2mWLY7dxXpSEbAWi8U5qgN2vBYre37bmPOILkObwHaIRtWiFDiSNja0zApdYNtbOpRJeISE4hzFZRYeWdSlPgxTioMB5sMC_yRu_Zd2wUVZUyj2ZzG_DJHMRrqlqkiKCHaSG8Erl8e1t6CfwyO634IpaGvHAKItdrqA?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/5ftP6luYqDigyHflTGCYor0qjSG5-E89Uf8JXzqSFtXfs012uO0-ZFsO0NIw_Q0GoYekFsJSI7aesATjgYfg69CzzFeh3cHJw0V7y4VraqI5YsRPbr2LKa6SUd0KihUwr7h652NNSonTd0qySEoq4GYHmcIAkQCqYwUErdEkG8MNOMM9ze5fJ8MYC5WA3W6R?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 z-0 flex max-w-[calc(100%-1rem)] flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-1.5\">\r\n<div class=\"shrink-0\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold\">6</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3372\" data-end=\"3506\">Dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng không phải là rác thải vô giá trị. Khi được xử lý đúng cách, nó có thể trở thành nguyên liệu cho nhiều lĩnh vực:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3671\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"y9nqrb\" data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3578\">Sản xuất <strong data-start=\"3519\" data-end=\"3532\">biodiesel</strong> – nhiên liệu sinh học thân thiện môi trường</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"7k8w10\" data-start=\"3579\" data-end=\"3611\">Làm xà phòng và chất tẩy rửa</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1voj8in\" data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3639\">Nguyên liệu công nghiệp</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1suy7j2\" data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3671\">Sản xuất năng lượng tái tạo</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3769\">Việc tái chế này không chỉ giảm thiểu rác thải mà còn góp phần phát triển nền kinh tế tuần hoàn.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"3771\" data-end=\"3774\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"je8f78\" data-start=\"3776\" data-end=\"3812\">Đối tượng cần thu mua dầu ăn thải</h2>\r\n<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/kSrB35_mXlyRBNpPP31t8PMK8Uv2var9anAlzSadfDNEtcC2SX73IHd7BpgcUORRUI9bx6jDsEHYhYTb9n5Pd4RYrMzAhNj_E8xyTOtKqMz3c3B4a1kK-cq2Enu0kqeXVwH0aglABZokEACNUw765YcfQqIdzN8D0riiq3noqo8?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/JoY5HoufEftVRTg0dKZqTS1uFNYNeODyHGsrhsrUEx3bxPgtiz9RsBdeUawJpJUMsoTVtj9Tc9zXyDHyXNF5cMMubmh996fX7hDAQxV1hTM1irbJsj_76wphXE7FtQ0FqyoAW7KPxIvIHBGtpQLZraX7kUB0WNedClDw08gf3tw8gBfUfb1ayCyYzdoAaTNK?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/-DBh2wrurPZ_Abi-t-iEyT5DxTyliag2HDp3-2acRdkoofHPyOAPc1DP_83pOr1ZeKSnFoFM4lsEKcdxqvHlcvd59CbUj10vRCVPjzEyLzFuP2WWU5waACWH0nurgHoML0wlINv1JHWLu_MrTFGZ7xqbj_DE46DXfNDoHIaVX0w?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/H25yxASG84OzR_EvZGcY_02vPC0ZAqzN9c59Ztlb4Uwf03k0mBELg7JyF1LVKf-cZY9c7EAUQoLm8jqnEgXIPcO-0D1r_hBQr2q_dJafwMIuuNwCYa4ekTHkPML3Xibv75I8HSUYxNfXyQ69ihe2YfDLuc0ZRvGeFrRZXCTLyQqH-pf0uv746yTJZgUMLlJs?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/FNr65tsDpoEDnnsTcjkmyMvkJ79rXdNAOV8zWb0fRLK4MH66SPu7h4f9Ke5o0-eIJZu5xAeP5_snqOhcg2rot29zUXcXqseMLTUiz0zIjJH_Xo9oGgygjjp0inhOC65IZ0qUtceS8Uob_aR3pLWnMNfDF1nlUjnvaHeKyjN8AIs?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/4XR8ZiyGgFlJNLRk5qnbU3qGVuUygK_6NnxAZwHq8pqiMtq3-6y9AvYqtmlGXaf-sZv3GemNDjB0t3JLDHXCqNwhFtXM1hU5PqDo19AI_YO1n_YkI8AurDI9JK9jgIrsxmdJ91Ed6W2VTf0JxOM7FH1Txz5GcavoeNOpBVrYgSyXS7iVgGaWV7crKFYv6qUb?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 z-0 flex max-w-[calc(100%-1rem)] flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-1.5\">\r\n<div class=\"shrink-0\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold\">6</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3856\" data-end=\"3904\">Chúng tôi nhận thu mua dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng từ:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"3906\" data-end=\"4040\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"27inol\" data-start=\"3906\" data-end=\"3927\">Nhà hàng, quán ăn</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1gr1g2k\" data-start=\"3928\" data-end=\"3949\">Khách sạn, resort</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"nax4w1\" data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"3984\">Bếp ăn công nghiệp, trường học</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"16py2ca\" data-start=\"3985\" data-end=\"4013\">Cơ sở chế biến thực phẩm</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1xf1d1b\" data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4040\">Hộ gia đình có nhu cầu</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4042\" data-end=\"4122\">Dù số lượng ít hay nhiều, chúng tôi đều hỗ trợ thu gom tận nơi với giá tốt nhất.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"4124\" data-end=\"4127\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1dwcun1\" data-start=\"4129\" data-end=\"4180\">Tiêu chí lựa chọn đơn vị thu mua dầu thải uy tín</h2>\r\n<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/tbhhZc5xo4_iSgfFPIjHlwB5VUYs1LLkNnGi_SQZVGtRFXuKmkkmlBXRlhVuTluF_iU4DoTfkkk1IXhq-5P5g4aTCMwTjpyZqu4JV7upVCgY3132lLjECyKNvhqsrzokO1kysz9UfPE8sATFWYMwKODpcpeZc1DT2JDH5jKEp9k?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/lW2-oN-NB05w2WIBT-Z5TBzvFnsSCkAkBUG6wB2q5c8p5NSFcMVGPBKEPP5z4zqYiMef3xElfXKLlpdLnLx86Br2cKcsH9NNvvT7iN2oUEkIehy7Jws7gePnCRS2yoj5Z74P9gJD6s_9f1KZv3ZLwbGXGEKzBd34duv45gHemXwHE4DVpbFdq1Kgfd1teIXV?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/eHe8aioqZsMkKtMMm_PtHYYWzQi7a0fzR30tqRsOPpO3Fze6jyAlkYpGocqlVFs-CnSEDG4QyWM2ZBhw9mo0Lpt7iqGl7JEZrMgL00VZRxlnFJb6iRNjemJ1stcpil5JL2itN8ddhgacEYqqMFCGYNJGJwuNEOyWBViXfLrc7zo?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/-bfBWeBh2O0PX8TApbJLcObnH7dGWchefFqGa4EoCJBLmWpZuwE8ZpytS_TlYS_KiL7Lpo3LQEEwBDc0tctX6Z9yKMUbGbdF7H1VUL_e9F1pzpiqHihazagxC0nFm4evH_6swF1WzdhpZuEgQbSZTpNLqBCKjo_G2Da3aKC4HBxsj858nTt9zUeR9DDiqHqi?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/f7TkGYYBh18ukT1Uo136VaFSuMfOOh7b2O8pOEwKaxpPouWIJHxhHl5faB3QNI4vg9AraAyn5SqYnMAcmkQ_vwaY2u4VWbrNb4WR7LYzgKC4zG2ZgsP7jyyypDOt-dRK8mygbhIaWrMY7ZPoUpC6EMvocD1f5lr_7JCk7g0e1oo?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/cp4omZACJN0m1AYKdUAv8RRKk0EvovWCsgFXF3Wu6esaGtixqfbOw8npx8lUEhNQy9gmc3gCfY4Hjw7cQlb09s8y6nZnT1IhL5l292_8xiJRlxq3gW9RndXF9uyaQlp7yvyTEg0C2dB4O1omc8qyWQ3ssjPGNBb0cs4irFWoIMJLQcvii_YNuXEl-5yG-H9Y?purpose=fullsize\" /></div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 z-0 flex max-w-[calc(100%-1rem)] flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-1.5\">\r\n<div class=\"shrink-0\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold\">7</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4224\" data-end=\"4267\">Khi lựa chọn đơn vị thu mua, bạn nên lưu ý:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"4269\" data-end=\"4446\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"lvth9g\" data-start=\"4269\" data-end=\"4303\">Có giấy phép hoạt động rõ ràng</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1twm9n8\" data-start=\"4304\" data-end=\"4341\">Giá thu mua minh bạch, cạnh tranh</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"hdfmud\" data-start=\"4342\" data-end=\"4369\">Quy trình chuyên nghiệp</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"ndojz9\" data-start=\"4370\" data-end=\"4403\">Thu gom nhanh chóng, đúng hẹn</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1d2jfxu\" data-start=\"4404\" data-end=\"4446\">Cam kết xử lý đúng quy định môi trường</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4448\" data-end=\"4523\">Một đơn vị uy tín sẽ giúp bạn yên tâm trong suốt quá trình hợp tác lâu dài.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"4525\" data-end=\"4528\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"quogs7\" data-start=\"4530\" data-end=\"4578\">Cam kết dịch vụ thu mua dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4580\" data-end=\"4598\">Chúng tôi cam kết:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"4600\" data-end=\"4756\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"neb839\" data-start=\"4600\" data-end=\"4636\">Thu mua với <strong data-start=\"4614\" data-end=\"4634\">giá cao, ổn định</strong></li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1istb7k\" data-start=\"4637\" data-end=\"4664\">Hỗ trợ thu gom <strong data-start=\"4654\" data-end=\"4662\">24/7</strong></li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1gtj87k\" data-start=\"4665\" data-end=\"4692\">Không phát sinh chi phí</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"6z4d9h\" data-start=\"4693\" data-end=\"4728\">Đội ngũ nhân viên chuyên nghiệp</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"fijjfo\" data-start=\"4729\" data-end=\"4756\">Hợp tác lâu dài, uy tín</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"4758\" data-end=\"4761\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1a8fy49\" data-start=\"4763\" data-end=\"4783\">Thông tin liên hệ</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4785\" data-end=\"4853\">Nếu bạn đang có nhu cầu bán dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng, hãy liên hệ ngay:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4855\" data-end=\"5040\"><strong data-start=\"4855\" data-end=\"4880\">Công ty XNK Ánh Trang</strong><br data-start=\"4880\" data-end=\"4883\" />🌐 Website: <a href=\"https://dauphethai.vn/\">www.dauphethai.vn </a>|<a href=\"https://anhtrangexport.vn/\"> www.anhtrangexport.vn</a><br data-start=\"4936\" data-end=\"4939\" />📧 Email: <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"4949\" data-end=\"4971\">info@anhtrangexport.vn</a><br data-start=\"4971\" data-end=\"4974\" />☎️ Điện thoại: 02436830880<br data-start=\"5000\" data-end=\"5003\" />📞 Hotline: <a href=\"http://zalo.me/84965069880\">0965069880</a> / 0943949083</p>','Thu mua dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng giá cao, uy tín toàn quốc','','publish','closed','open','','thu-mua-dau-an-da-qua-su-dung-gia-cao','','','2026-04-28 00:12:48','2026-04-27 17:12:48','',0,'https://dauandaquasudung.com/?p=1828',0,'post','',0),(1829,4,'2026-04-28 00:12:38','2026-04-27 17:12:38','','ChatGPT Image 00_12_22 28 thg 4, 2026','','inherit','closed','closed','','chatgpt-image-00_12_22-28-thg-4-2026','','','2026-04-28 00:12:38','2026-04-27 17:12:38','',1828,'https://dauandaquasudung.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ChatGPT-Image-00_12_22-28-thg-4-2026.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(1830,4,'2026-04-28 00:12:48','2026-04-27 17:12:48','<h2 data-section-id=\"kdm190\" data-start=\"75\" data-end=\"129\">Giới thiệu về dịch vụ thu mua dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng</h2>\n<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\">\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/sjPiBW8r