vQeDr0qf8_0LrAHk-_VG-KGaqJ17D7K8EqryOkJmO0MmirYiGeqYLAaVt3A4CEOvg1Xd-n_suf1RS_rAY7tTIBVMuc3sT-Dy3UwkLGWfDXYydW9Myi6C_tX2FpUsFQSuz5k7wr9TOsb5xxCPAgKeTXM6GUc?purpose=inline\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover lazy-load-active\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/8kqkSRY38pblQli31MN7uIA7xykdtR1SUOa9WUE3rMjyQkUx26G2nlrcIxdAKKHewEqfk2WUwdcuMSi8UrIYnhgMHYUqrZfFpKkZOG8TLm8WPDy6PuhemnQ-XZDc-NSYsY82srp4TrPQCkitZjc9Yd8RFhpplX-7Dm7lA8dYWM8?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/xezGQAnFD1VE_G7chE77wWGLw2WatYcItzeNxeijDiOBkx3MNpriIFmkqpiityJsQXENMLVlnLmcMKbDOlxL7_TZ5rdoWnUsp7PllSQ3lTYP7Y5E5koueLWcF5NkYkmKZuh_RGTgm5Ca1y-GMj9kyjGdyLduEta07otdYMk3BgXw-_UCavJxi6zwXcqjWD8H?purpose=fullsize\" data-src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/8kqkSRY38pblQli31MN7uIA7xykdtR1SUOa9WUE3rMjyQkUx26G2nlrcIxdAKKHewEqfk2WUwdcuMSi8UrIYnhgMHYUqrZfFpKkZOG8TLm8WPDy6PuhemnQ-XZDc-NSYsY82srp4TrPQCkitZjc9Yd8RFhpplX-7Dm7lA8dYWM8?purpose=inline\" /></div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 z-0 flex max-w-[calc(100%-1rem)] flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-1.5\">\r\n<div class=\"shrink-0\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold\">6</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"1003\">Dầu ăn đã qua sử dụng là loại dầu đã được dùng để chiên, rán nhiều lần. Khi bị đun nóng liên tục ở nhiệt độ cao, dầu sẽ biến đổi về mặt hóa học và vật lý:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1132\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"17u49lw\" data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1049\">Chuyển màu từ vàng sang nâu sẫm hoặc đen</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"8tzyxy\" data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1077\">Xuất hiện mùi khét, hôi</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1arhwnx\" data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1102\">Tạo bọt khi đun nóng</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"p8vei1\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1132\">Gia tăng các chất độc hại</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1243\">Dầu đen là giai đoạn dầu đã bị biến chất nghiêm trọng, không còn an toàn để sử dụng trong chế biến thực phẩm.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1248\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1s1ulr1\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1295\"><span id=\"2_Hinh_thanh_cac_chat_doc_hai_gay_ung_thu\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span>2. Hình thành các chất độc hại gây ung thư</h2>\r\n<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\r\n<div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover lazy-load-active\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/J0RQZO79qIIJ1Ra01byt9RVAtKEJec6Yzalph818xGYvA9ln0fgWorW7VtbzpGkd-64v_Hi-_MxvaiogrlrWhtHwDczVvqIrVPmlsrsrh6CQ8AeZHTXWFyzoNpzfLaAa5ayQbkp3-JTj4yepi-l6CZWNY4dotL_J01ql0WpMC6U?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/J75Wp9hUJul8uVAi91pPxvMcosucaNSK5r73ak7fxnTTAGZ204LlyEBzIHaADcC_yLYe93jS4gzoSL34sxvS0kERIeN_J14YGfsghcw4GNHK6Oq_8-LIk2ZTOgVlRa6tZ8OvcQ1qmlYCCkV8dTr_kouY8tlEfq0tTeeEjB97HEAXJCqEySoqkGUHoCprWXJ-?purpose=fullsize\" data-src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/J0RQZO79qIIJ1Ra01byt9RVAtKEJec6Yzalph818xGYvA9ln0fgWorW7VtbzpGkd-64v_Hi-_MxvaiogrlrWhtHwDczVvqIrVPmlsrsrh6CQ8Ae